<div class="">
  <p class="user-inner-content">
    Dear <%= @user.name%><br>
  </p>
  <p class="user-inner-content">
    We have received a request to reset the password for your account.<br>
    Username: <%= @user.username %><br>
    To reset your password, please click the link below or open it in your browser:<br>
    <a href="<%= @user.reset_password_link_url %>">Reset Your Password </a><br>
    If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email or contact us for further assistance.<br>
  </p>
  <p class="user-inner-content">
    Best regards,<br>
    The Secure Engage Team<br>
  </p>
</div>